{
  "$schema": "../../../schemas/lesson.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "linux.permission.triplet-01",
  "title": "权限数字转 rwx（C 教学模型）",
  "track": "linux-basics",
  "language": "c",
  "questionType": "programming",
  "difficulty": "beginner",
  "summary": "用位运算把一个权限数字转换成三位权限文本，不修改电脑上的实际权限。",
  "prerequisites": [],
  "knowledge": [
    "基本权限位",
    "位运算",
    "字符数组"
  ],
  "target": "native",
  "starter": "starter",
  "statement": "README.md",
  "build": {
    "standard": "c11",
    "sources": [
      "permissions.c"
    ],
    "tests": [
      "test_permissions.c"
    ],
    "includeDirs": [
      "."
    ],
    "timeoutSeconds": 5
  },
  "hints": [
    "只处理一组 r/w/x 权限，不是完整的三位 chmod 模式。",
    "r、w、x 对应位掩码 4、2、1；未设置的位写成 '-'。",
    "先拒绝大于 7 的输入；成功时别忘记字符串末尾的 '\\0'。"
  ],
  "origin": {
    "type": "self-authored",
    "license": "project-license"
  }
}
